{"server":"cn","storyId":"act12d0_level_act12d0_ex01_end","groupId":"act12d0","stageId":"act12d0_ex01","title":"声东击西","storyCode":"RI-EX-1","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_ex01_end.txt","sourceHash":"9f8120eeac3d4c50ab897c6d7ef9913d4df9d651bb15540097cf5d965cf4653f","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"因为行动工具的抛锚，AUS不得不进入丛林求助。\n她们和她们带来的音乐引起了当地人剧烈的反响。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"烈日，荒野，黄沙，热风！wohoo！新的歌曲在我的心中诞生了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"（solo）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"你们两个太吵了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"确实。难得有这么空旷又无人的环境，不用担心被追赶的事，就不能安静地休息一会吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，Alty，这里也能闻到海的气息，真的安全吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Aya，你真是一如既往的不解风情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"这片大地上没有安全的地方，但我们总要学会给自己放松一下，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"或许你是对的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"所以下一步，我们要用什么拓宽前进的道路？总不能再空手而归了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，这次那个医生已经给了我们答案。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Alty看了看手中的“钥匙”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"真的吗真的吗？这个东西看上去可不普通，她居然愿意把这个东西给你？你拿啥换的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"知识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"知识与这东西是等价的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不清楚，不过我觉得医生她是在催促我们去运用这个知识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"她会不知道这些吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我们知道多少，她应该就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"......仔细想想，真正的交易内容，应该是用我们的好奇心换来了我们的行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"这，她不是啥都没出吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"被骗了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"不，应该说是被诱导了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"被指挥了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"被指引了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"当真有这么重要吗，这个医生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"不重要。我觉得这个医生正是想告诉我们，她的举动并不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"重要的是我们怎么想，怎么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"那钥匙呢？我们要去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，很麻烦。能不能不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我想这就和音乐一样......我们不应该拥有一种可以强制改变别人的力量，我们只是唱自己的歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"唱给他们听，如果好听——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"那他们也会唱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"（solo）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，那就把更多的知识和钥匙都交给准备好了的人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"会是谁呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"还不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"说不定还没出生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"那太好了，但愿他还没出生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"别期待这种事情，Dan，我们......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了，Alty。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"车没能量了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"你没有准备吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"准备了，但我们之前绕路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我必须承认，在这种没有公路也没有道标的荒野上行驶，很容易丧失方向感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是说，我们迷路了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"不能完全这么说，在大方向上，我们并没有偏离，只能说我们在开辟新的道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"迷路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"迷路！这也是个不错的题材。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"不得不说，Dan，我有时候真想学学你的乐观。那怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"那个方向好像有一片雨林，我们去那边看看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"那，谁来推车？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"或许我们可以轮流来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Alty。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"干什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我们周边已经聚集了不少人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们听不懂他们的语言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"所以就这样让他们跟着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"你有更好的方法吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"把他们全都解决掉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你能说服Frost和Dan的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"（弹唱）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"&*......%￥......&（这、这是什么声音，为什么会这么好听？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"&%......%（我从没听过这样的声音......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，你们好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"你们说的是什么语言啊，可以告诉我吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，虽然你们说了我也不会知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人C","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"......%&￥（这些人是哪里来的？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人D","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"￥......&#（这家伙怎么长得这么奇怪？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，至少这里有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"如果这里有能让我们补给的地方就更好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我认为你在做梦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"你们是外乡人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你说的是萨尔贡语？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，看来你们确实是外乡人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"你们为什么来这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的车耗尽了能量，所以一路来到这里想要找一些懂源石技艺的人帮我们补充一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"......跟我来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，Aya，这不是出现了希望吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，这片大地真是无奇不有。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"喂喂喂，喂喂喂喂喂，怎么回事，怎么回事啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"在这样一片原始的雨林里，竟然有这样一座村庄！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"（哼唱）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"确实令人吃惊，大部分的建筑都有现代建筑的影子，但也保留了原始的美感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"很古怪，但也很独特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"我是这个部族的族长，祖玛玛，我的部族的人大部分都能听懂你们说的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以安排一些部族祭司给你们的交通工具补充能量，但是我有条件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"什么样的条件？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"我想看一看你们的车的内部构造。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"......就这样就可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"你确定你不会把我们的车搞坏吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"应该不会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Alty？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我想我们并没有多少选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"所以？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我们同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"好。大祭司爷爷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"来了！......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"你们是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到在这里能遇到你这样的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，不瞒你们说，我也是这么想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"不过比起你们，我还是对你们的车更加好奇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"请便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我要重复一下刚才的话，这片大地真是无奇不有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我难得同意你的意见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"这时，frost把吉他接上了祭祀用的音响，开始了一段即兴独奏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"不错啊，Frost。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"这座奇特的村庄给了我灵感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"好帅啊，Frost，这次的旋律还加入了一些变化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"炽热，压抑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我把这段曲子，取名为......《D》！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哪里来的声音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么声音？我感觉我浑身都充满了力量！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好像是刚才来的外乡人！快去看看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"人越来越多了，Alty......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"不妙哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"这些生命在渴望音乐！渴望力量！渴望......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这个声音是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"外乡人啊，请留下更多的声音！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Alty......虽然很突然，不过我觉得现在的氛围也很适合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"干脆把我们的音响搬出来，一起上去演奏一曲吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"总之我不反对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊好啊，可不能让Frost一个人抢了风头！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"这么劲爆的编曲，我不参一脚怎么行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"那就让这里的人感受我们的AUS的音乐吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为什么只是一些声音，我却兴奋得停不下来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这难道和祭司们用的祭乐一样，是所谓的“乐曲”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我从没听过这样的乐曲！她们究竟是什么人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人D","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了，她们一定是“奎卡亚提”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"“奎卡亚提”？这是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，这是他们的语言中对“唱歌的人”的称呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"这里已经很久没有出现过“奎卡亚提”了，你们的音乐征服了她们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我不得不说，你们的音乐和我过去听过的奎卡亚提的音乐完全不一样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"但是没有关系，我觉得你们的音乐更加有趣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人E","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“奎卡亚提”，再给我们演奏一曲吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人F","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们想要什么都可以，再来一曲吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么办，Alty？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"留下来吧，Alty！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我想提醒你们不要忘记我们的目标......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，好吧，我们有的是时间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到这里还有信使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"我也没想到只在杂志上见过的AUS竟然会来到这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"祖玛玛呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"她在制造你们想要的音响，所以由我来给你带路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"你们打算在这里待多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"也许是一周，也许是一个月，也许是一年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"这里点燃了我们，那我们至少要在这里尽兴才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"那么这里应该更加适合你们演出。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_temple_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"好酷的地方！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是......某种神庙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，这里过去是所有部族聚集在一起举办“玛维索提亚”的地方，不过自从嘉维尔离开后，已经很久没有用过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"“玛维索提亚”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔？我好像在罗德岛上看过这个名字......算了，应该只是同名吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"你们可以在这里进行你们的演出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"让这里的人享受最好的音乐吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，没错，在这里留下属于AUS的痕迹吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"两个月后"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"AUS真是一些不可思议的家伙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然就真的在这里停留了两个月。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"这下嘉维尔要是哪天回来的话恐怕会大吃一惊吧，这样一个偏僻的地方，竟然也出现了音乐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的人竟然爱上了摇滚乐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，今天她们又打算带来什么样的演出呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"......说不定最狂热的是我自己也说不定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"AUS的各位......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"房间是空的，各种生活用品和被褥也都摆放整齐，中央的简易桌子上，放着一张纸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"难道她们离开了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"桌上的这封信，我看看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"“我们走了，勿念。愿音乐能带给你们欢乐。还有，我们把我们的唱片全都留在了这里，尽情享受吧。——AUS”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵，真是一群不可思议的家伙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我想我不会忘记这个叫做阿卡胡拉的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"（哼唱）一次难忘的经历。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"但是这里的人还是太吵了，而且太野蛮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？我很喜欢啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"你当然喜欢，我觉得把你留在那里你也不会反对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我确实犹豫了很久诶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"你们不觉得这里的人拥有一种天然的、原始的活力吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我们已经去过很多国家很多城市了，但是没有一个地方的人是这样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我喜欢他们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，这一点我确实无法否认。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"他们理解了我们的音乐，他们是最棒的听众。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"看来Frost也很中意他们呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"可不该把别人的生活搅得天翻地覆。只要唱歌就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"唱给他们听，如果好听——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"那他们也会唱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是不是说过一样的话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"谁知道呢，我们或许说过无数次同样的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，我们该继续我们的旅途了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"把歌声唱给这片大地，他会倾听吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"几个人在车上，开了个玩笑就结束了。\nAlty看着手中的钥匙，凯尔希医生啊，你们罗德岛能给这片大地想要的答案吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_416_zumama","aliases":["森蚺"]}]}
